 "description": "\n <ul> \n  <li>Cool and Comfortable: This pet mat features self-cooling technology, providing a cool and comfortable surface for your pet during hot summer months, making it ideal for cats and dogs.</li> \n  <li>Breathable Ice Silk Material: This ice silk self-cooling folding mat is made of premium ice silk fabric, promoting air circulation to keep your pet cool and comfortable, ideal for naps and relaxation.</li> \n  <li>Washable and Easy to Clean: Our portable pet cooling mat is washable, convenient, and easy to clean. With minimal effort, you can ensure your pet mat stays fresh and hygienic.</li> \n  <li>Multiple Sizes Available: This extra-large self-cooling mat is suitable for pets of all sizes, ensuring every cat and dog enjoys a cool and comfortable experience.</li> \n  <li>Portable and Lightweight: This portable pet mat is easy to fold and carry, making it ideal for travel, outdoor adventures, or home activities, keeping your pet cool anytime, anywhere.<br><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/170e5f31-98dc-4b94-8894-81b09c67030b.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><br><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/df48118d-a2e8-46d3-bbd0-38858b7a3c28.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><br><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/9dfada96-422c-48ca-b140-7f10699e5e2e.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"><br><img src=\"https://cf.cjdropshipping.com/48ca3196-67c0-471a-8b71-155a12ce755b.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" contenteditable=\"false\"></li> \n </ul>\n",
